### Stylework Lead Tracker - REST API Client Tests
@baseUrl = https://stylework-leads-crud.onrender.com
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. List All Leads (Paginated & Sorted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search Leads by Name / Email / Phone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?search=Aarav
Accept: application/json

### 4. Filter Leads by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?status=Contacted
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Pipeline KPI Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/stats
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create New Lead
# @name createLead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rohan Gupta",
  "email": "rohan.gupta@enterprise.io",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "status": "New",
  "notes": "Looking for 15 dedicated desks in Gurgaon."
}

### 7. Get Lead by ID (Use ID from step 6 or an existing ID)
@createdId = {{createLead.response.body.data._id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{createdId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Update Lead Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{createdId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Qualified"
}

### 9. Delete Lead
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{createdId}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Export Leads to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/export/csv
